 ## Shared principles
-All methods in this family operate on the set of $N$ 3D Gaussian primitives defined in [Optimization and Training](17385-optimization-and-training.md) [G]. The core mechanism involves a periodic densification step, typically executed every $K=100$ iterations starting after a warm-up period (e.g., iteration 100) [G].
